IMPORT `g4-tests-fixtures`

-- g4-tests-forks.l4: one section per fork of the Interpretation record (F4.1 to F4.11): the discriminating case, asserted on every reading, both through the public function (with the alternate
-- reading as the record) and through the function of the reading itself. The expected values were decided from the Law's text and from the words of each reading BEFORE the encoding was run.
-- The default reading is `the default reading`; each alternate differs from it in exactly one field (g4-tests-fixtures.l4).

§ `Tests of the forks of Articles 11 and 12`

§§ `F4.1 -- the twelve months preceding the application`

-- The application is lodged and complete on 15 March 2026. The three readings draw three windows:
--   A (taken): 15 March 2025 to 14 March 2026, both ends inclusive (a year back from the day, ending the day before it);
--   B: 16 March 2025 to 15 March 2026 (twelve months ending on the day of the application, so starting the day after the anniversary);
--   C: 1 March 2025 to 28 February 2026 (the twelve whole calendar months before March 2026).
#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the twelve months preceding the application` `the default reading` `the base application` EQUALS (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2025 3 15), (YMD 2026 3 14))
#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the twelve months preceding the application` `reading F4.1 B` `the base application` EQUALS (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2025 3 16), (YMD 2026 3 15))
#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the twelve months preceding the application` `reading F4.1 C` `the base application` EQUALS (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2025 3 1), (YMD 2026 2 28))
#ASSERT `F4.1 reading A: the twelve months ending on the day before the application` `the default reading` (YMD 2026 3 15) EQUALS (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2025 3 15), (YMD 2026 3 14))
#ASSERT `F4.1 reading B: the twelve months ending on the day of the application` `the default reading` (YMD 2026 3 15) EQUALS (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2025 3 16), (YMD 2026 3 15))
#ASSERT `F4.1 reading C: the twelve whole calendar months before the month of the application` (YMD 2026 3 15) EQUALS (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2025 3 1), (YMD 2026 2 28))
-- Reading C in January: the twelve whole calendar months before January 2026 are the calendar year 2025.
#ASSERT `F4.1 reading C: the twelve whole calendar months before the month of the application` (YMD 2026 1 20) EQUALS (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2025 1 1), (YMD 2025 12 31))

-- Payment dates against the three windows. Each row: the date, then whether it is inside under A, B, C.
#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `the default reading` `the base application` (YMD 2025 2 28)
#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 B` `the base application` (YMD 2025 2 28)
#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 C` `the base application` (YMD 2025 2 28)

#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `the default reading` `the base application` (YMD 2025 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 B` `the base application` (YMD 2025 3 1)
#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 C` `the base application` (YMD 2025 3 1)

#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `the default reading` `the base application` (YMD 2025 3 14)
#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 B` `the base application` (YMD 2025 3 14)
#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 C` `the base application` (YMD 2025 3 14)

#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `the default reading` `the base application` (YMD 2025 3 15)
#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 B` `the base application` (YMD 2025 3 15)
#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 C` `the base application` (YMD 2025 3 15)

#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `the default reading` `the base application` (YMD 2025 3 16)
#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 B` `the base application` (YMD 2025 3 16)
#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 C` `the base application` (YMD 2025 3 16)

#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `the default reading` `the base application` (YMD 2026 2 28)
#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 B` `the base application` (YMD 2026 2 28)
#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 C` `the base application` (YMD 2026 2 28)

#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `the default reading` `the base application` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 B` `the base application` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `reading F4.1 C` `the base application` (YMD 2026 3 1)

#ASSERT `Art 11(2)(e)(ii) the payment to a governor is within the period` `the default reading` `the base application` (YMD 2026 3 14)
